<title>USA: U.S. Diagnostic Labs completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>U.S. Diagnostic Labs completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Diagnostic Labs Inc said Tuesday it has completed the purchase of Quantum Imaging which owns 10 diagnostic imaging facilities in the greater Houston market.</p>
<p>As a result of this transaction and the previously announced purchase of US Imaging, U.S. Diagnostic now owns 14 centers in the Houston area.</p>
<p>It said these new facilities add about $12.5 million in revenues and $2.5 million to annual net income before taxes, or $0.06 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
